! ==============================================================
! CISCO WLC 9800 / AIR-CT5520 CONFIGURATION SCRIPT
! Đề tài: Thiết kế hạ tầng mạng không dây DTHU
! ==============================================================

! 1. Thiết lập Interface Quản trị WLC
wireless management interface Vlan50

! 2. Cấu hình High Availability N+1 (Active-Standby SSO)
chassis redundancy ha-interface GigabitEthernet 0/0/2
chassis redundancy keepalive-timer 100
chassis redundancy peer-ip 172.16.50.11
chassis redundancy unit 1 primary

! 3. Khởi tạo Profile WLAN DTHU_STUDENT (Wi-Fi 6 + 802.1X)
wlan DTHU_STUDENT 20 DTHU_STUDENT
 client vlan 20
 security wpa psk set-key ascii 0 Disabled
 security wpa wpa2
 security wpa wpa2 ciphers aes
 security wpa akm 802.1x
 security dot1x authentication-list DTHU_RADIUS_AAA
 radio dot11a
 radio dot11bg
 dot11v bss-transition
 dot11k neighbor-list
 dot11r ft
 no shutdown

! 4. Kích hoạt tính năng Client Isolation (Bảo vệ sinh viên)
wlan DTHU_STUDENT
 peer-blocking drop
